 * Sketch (BPMN, DMN, PMML)
 -> #/sketch/\{bpmn,dmn,pmml}
 * New workspace (BPMN, DMN, PMML)
 -> #/workspace/new/ \{bpmn,dmn,pmml}
 -> Upload files -> Create workspace then redirect to #/workspace/\{name}/overview
