description:
Currently, to switch between quarkus and spring boot runtimes the user would need 
{code:bash}
--set image.repository=quay.io/kiegroup/examples-process-springboot-example,runtime=springboot
{code}
We should give users the option to set the runtime to springboot, without needing to provide the image repository. 
{code:bash}
--set runtime=springboot
{code}
By default, the runtime should be quarkus.

